157 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 156 0 R
  /Alt (This diagram illustrates a generic production process workflow for Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) products, detailing five sequential stages: Input data, Pre-processing, Processing, Post-processing, and Output products. 1. **Input data**: This stage involves sourcing data from Sentinel-x, Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) specific datasets, Ancillary data, and other unspecified data sources. 2. **Pre-processing**: This stage includes multiple concurrent or sequential activities: 'Scene selection, check and correction', 'Extraction, quality control and calibration', and 'Classification and optimization'. 3. **Processing**: This core stage encompasses 'Metrics generation, classification (e.g. threshold tunning, visual interpretation) data fusion processing'. During this processing phase, 'Quality control and product verification' is also conducted. 4. **Post-processing**: This stage focuses on refining the processed data through 'Filtering and harmonization, integration of ancillary data, classification improvements, product preparation'. 5. **Output products**: The final outputs generated are a 'Status layer', a 'Change, auxiliary, reference layer', and 'Other datasets'.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [12]
  /Pg 580 0 R
>>
endobj

